      "content": "it's just that everything feels so heavy. it's like i'm just existing in this loop of nothingness. i was thinking about it last night and it actually seemed like the most logical thing in the world. just to stop. no more caretaking, no more regret, no more waking up to a world that doesn't make sense. why is it so wrong to just want the noise to stop?",
